      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_4",
      "quote": "Despite accumulating evidence of its diagnostic accuracy over the last decade, scepticism regarding its clinical effectiveness and cost‑efficiency continues to hinder widespread acceptance. ... Research indicates that keeping FERs under 30% is essential for encouraging patients to prefer CCE over colonoscopy. ... Despite its significance, a systematic review of FER in CCE remains absent.",
